<title>AUSTRIA: Algeria does not want change in OPEC ceiling.</title>
<headline>Algeria does not want change in OPEC ceiling.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian oil minister Amar Makhloufi said on Tuesday that he did not want a change in OPEC's output ceiling.</p>
<p>When asked whether he wanted a change he replied &quot;no.&quot;</p>
<p>He also saw no problem in accommodating renewed Iraqi exports.</p>
<p>&quot;Iraq is not problem,&quot; he said in response to reporters' questions on his arrival here.  </p>
<p>Makhloufi was the last OPEC oil minister to arrive here for Wednesday's meeting, scheduled to start at 1400 gmt.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
